{"id":"00289","root":"uni00289_1","name":{"ja":"眞田　焔","en":"Sanada Homura"},"title":{"ja":"【槍炎の戦闘狂】","en":"【Spear Flame Battle Maniac】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【槍炎の戦闘狂】 眞田　焔","en":"【Spear Flame Battle Maniac】 Sanada Homura"},"element":"Natural","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2020-01-31","limited":true,"characterId":49,"profile":{"ja":"対魔忍として、長らく任務に就いていた女性。その実力は折り紙つきだが、非常に血の気が多く、闘う事しか考えていない戦闘狂。そのため、ひとたび任務から里に戻ると、教師だろうが生徒だろうがお構い無しに特訓と称してボコっているため、一部からは恐れられている。実はちゃんと実力を認めている相手を選んでいるため、それを知っている者は止める事はしない。戦闘スタイルは、長槍術に火遁を織り交ぜたもの。槍の柄を爆発させてロケットのように突っ込み、触れる者を焼き払うという豪快な戦闘をする。そのため任務では陽動役を命じられる事が多く、彼女が超火力を振り回す間に、他の対魔忍が要人を暗殺するといった作戦が取られることが多い。本人は好き勝手に暴れる事ができて満足している。とはいえその戦い方にはリスクも多く、敵の策略にはまり敗北を喫する事もある。しかし彼女は「それなら、全て突破出来る力を手に入れればいい」と強引な解決案にたどりつくのだった。","en":"Sanada Homura has long served as a Taimanin. Her skill is unquestionable, but she's extremely hot-blooded and a combat fanatic who thinks of nothing but fighting. Consequently, whenever she returns from a mission to the village, she beats up anyone—teacher or student alike—under the pretense of training, earning fear from some quarters. In truth, she only chooses opponents she truly respects, and those who know this never try to stop her. Her combat style blends spear techniques with fire style; she detonates the spear's shaft to launch it like a rocket, scorching anything it touches. Because of this flamboyant fighting, she's often assigned as a diversion in missions, allowing other Taimanin to assassinate key targets while she unleashes overwhelming firepower. She's satisfied simply by rampaging at will. Still, her approach carries many risks, and she sometimes falls into enemy traps and suffers defeat. Yet she concludes, \"If that's the case, I'll just obtain the power to break through everything,\" and pursues forceful solutions."},"illustrator":"のぶしと","voiceActor":"疾風はる","forms":[{"id":"uni00289_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[994,1988],"sp":[160,160],"